00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:21.060
are the hemoglobin and the
white blood cell count.

00:03:21.060 --> 00:03:23.200
If I'm looking to see if
you have an infection,

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:25.860
that white blood cell count
number can be low or high,

00:03:25.860 --> 00:03:27.110
that's important to know.

